The files in this directory are a Debian packaging scaffold. They have not been
validated as a buildable or installable Debian package, and this project does
not define a Debian package version or provide `debian/changelog`.

The current rules use the Python build frontend and pip; they are not a complete
`pybuild` integration. Validate and convert the scaffold in a target Debian
distribution that provides Python 3.15 before producing a package. Review build
dependencies, runtime dependencies, GUI availability, and device permissions
for that distribution. The optional GUI suggestion is `python3-pyside6.qtwidgets`.
